# Generated artefacts are committed and regenerated by cli/, so their line
# endings have to be the same on every machine or a Windows contributor dirties
# the tree simply by following CONTRIBUTING. The writers pin newline="\n"; this
# is the second lock, for anything that reaches git another way.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
